Isolated media analysis runtime

The Node service loads only Node built-ins and this repository's code.
Python is a separate program. It uses only the limited OpenCV build below;
media decoding remains in the existing separate FFmpeg program.

OpenCV 4.12.0, Apache-2.0, plus the bundled third-party notices in
opencv-licenses/. The source includes the built-in Protobuf parser and
SoftFloat; their original notices and the MSCR notice travel beside it.
Source: https://github.com/opencv/opencv/archive/4.12.0/opencv-4.12.0.tar.gz
SHA512: 8ac63ddd61e22cc0eaeafee4f30ae6e1cab05fc4929e2cea29070203b9ca8dfead12cc0fd7c4a87b65c1e20ec6b9ab4865a1b83fad33d114fc0708fdf107c51b
The Dockerfile records the complete CMake flags. CMakeCache.txt, install
manifest and installed package lists are in /opt/opencv/build-record/.
FFmpeg, GStreamer, GUI and dynamic backend plugins are disabled.

PySceneDetect 0.7.2 (scenedetect-headless distribution), BSD-3-Clause.
Source: https://github.com/Breakthrough/PySceneDetect/tree/v0.7.2
Wheel: https://files.pythonhosted.org/packages/e3/14/727cbb58c72d6df4520153ea6788e1efdebb5d6b446392c784017c70ce0a/scenedetect_headless-0.7.2-py3-none-any.whl
SHA256: 583fd5dbc2418f027a1c17c3444d0bbd8cb630357e19705c4f68ae4c1aa51ef2
Its wheel is extracted without resolving dependencies; OpenCV comes from the
limited source build. The wheel's own LICENSE and metadata are preserved.

Python 3.12.16, Python-2.0; NumPy 2.3.5, BSD-3-Clause and the original
third-party notices in its installed LICENSE.txt. Installed Python package
licences remain in each distribution's dist-info/licenses or LICENSE files.
Python: https://www.python.org/ftp/python/3.12.16/Python-3.12.16.tar.xz
NumPy: https://github.com/numpy/numpy/tree/v2.3.5
The GCC runtime libraries (libgcc, libstdc++, libgfortran) carry
GPL-3.0-or-later WITH GCC-exception-3.1; GCC-COPYING3 and
GCC-COPYING.RUNTIME carry those original texts.
Source: https://gcc.gnu.org/pub/gcc/releases/gcc-15.2.0/gcc-15.2.0.tar.xz
Exception: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/gcc-mirror/gcc/releases/gcc-15.2.0/COPYING.RUNTIME
OpenBLAS: https://github.com/OpenMathLib/OpenBLAS/tree/v0.3.30

Alpine package versions, declared licences and exact aports recipe commits
are appended from the installed package database when this image builds.
The recipe for an installed package is available under
https://gitlab.alpinelinux.org/alpine/aports/-/tree/<commit>/<repository>/<origin>.
The pre-existing media-program SOURCE and COPYING notices remain in their
own /usr/share/ffmpeg-source, vips-source and sox-source directories.
